@startuml anemic-sell-sequence
!include ../../sellStocks/diagrams/sell-style.puml
title A service-centered alternative
caption Illustrative design — not implemented on main
participant "Operation service" as S
participant "Shared eligibility policy" as E
participant "Lot data" as L
participant "Result calculator" as C
S -> L: Read lot state
L --> S: Lots and remaining quantities
S -> E: Select eligible lots for one time
E --> S: Eligible lots in defined order
S -> S: Check capacity before mutation
S -> L: Apply the consumption plan
S -> C: Gross proceeds, cost basis, fee
C --> S: Consistent result
note over S
A service-based design can be correct.
Review mutation control and reuse,
not only method length.
end note
@enduml
